@title: UPLOAD into a field inside an iframe
STEP 1: A same-origin frame
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/upload.html
    UPLOAD '@TESTDATA@/files/notes.txt' to 'Attachment'
    VERIFY that 'Attachment got notes.txt (17 bytes)' is present
    VERIFY that 'Evidence got' is NOT present
STEP 2: A cross-site frame (its own process in Chrome)
    UPLOAD '@TESTDATA@/files/notes.txt' to 'Evidence'
    VERIFY that 'Evidence got notes.txt (17 bytes)' is present
DONE.
